---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Window from '../components/Window.astro';
import MobileTitlebar from '../components/MobileTitlebar.astro';
---

<AppLayout
  title="Squash · Ishan Rajpurohit"
  description="Why squash takes up Ishan Rajpurohit's evenings."
>
  <Window title="Squash" height={738} transitionName="active-window">
    <div class="squash-content">
      <div class="squash-text">
        <h1>Squash takes up my evenings.</h1>
        <div class="squash-body">
          <p>Between design projects and engineering classes, you&rsquo;ll usually find me on a squash court in the evenings.</p>
          <p>Sports has taught me far more than the game itself. It&rsquo;s about consistency, patience, and how small improvements compound over time, and you eventually start carrying that into other domains of your life. More importantly, it&rsquo;s introduced me to a community that makes every day worth showing up for.</p>
          <p>I&rsquo;ll probably always have a squash kitbag leaning somewhere near my desk.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="squash-collage">
        <div class="collage-col">
          <div class="collage-tile collage-tile--tall">
            <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-1.jpg" alt="Reaching low for a forehand on court" />
          </div>
          <div class="collage-tile collage-tile--short">
            <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-2.jpg" alt="Rallying at close range with an opponent" class="pos-right" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collage-col">
          <div class="collage-tile collage-tile--short">
            <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-3.jpg" alt="Mid-swing forehand shot" />
          </div>
          <div class="collage-tile collage-tile--tall">
            <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-4.jpg" alt="Lunging for a backhand near the wall" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Window>

  <Fragment slot="mobile">
    <MobileTitlebar title="Squash" />
    <div class="m-squash">
      <h1>Squash takes up my evenings.</h1>
      <div class="m-squash-body">
        <p>Between design projects and engineering classes, you&rsquo;ll usually find me on a squash court in the evenings.</p>
        <div class="m-squash-collage">
          <div class="m-collage-col">
            <div class="m-collage-tile m-collage-tile--tall">
              <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-1.jpg" alt="Reaching low for a forehand on court" />
            </div>
            <div class="m-collage-tile m-collage-tile--short">
              <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-2.jpg" alt="Rallying at close range with an opponent" class="pos-right" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="m-collage-col">
            <div class="m-collage-tile m-collage-tile--short">
              <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-3.jpg" alt="Mid-swing forehand shot" />
            </div>
            <div class="m-collage-tile m-collage-tile--tall">
              <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-4.jpg" alt="Lunging for a backhand near the wall" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Sports has taught me far more than the game itself. It&rsquo;s about consistency, patience, and how small improvements compound over time, and you eventually start carrying that into other domains of your life. More importantly, it&rsquo;s introduced me to a community that makes every day worth showing up for.</p>
        <p>I&rsquo;ll probably always have a squash kitbag leaning somewhere near my desk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</AppLayout>

<style>
  .squash-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 72px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .squash-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    width: 653px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .squash-text h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #000;
  }

  .squash-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .squash-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #443a3a;
  }

  .squash-collage {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    width: 260px;
    height: 526px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .collage-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .collage-tile {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .collage-tile--tall {
    flex: 1.2;
  }

  .collage-tile--short {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .collage-tile img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .collage-tile img.pos-right {
    object-position: 75% center;
  }

  .m-squash {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .m-squash-collage {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    float: right;
    width: 42%;
    max-width: 168px;
    aspect-ratio: 260 / 526;
    margin: 4px 0 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .m-collage-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .m-collage-tile {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .m-collage-tile--tall {
    flex: 1.2;
  }

  .m-collage-tile--short {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .m-collage-tile img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .m-collage-tile img.pos-right {
    object-position: 75% center;
  }

  .m-squash h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #000;
  }

  .m-squash-body::after {
    content: '';
    display: table;
    clear: both;
  }

  .m-squash-body p {
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #443a3a;
  }

  .m-squash-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
